	(text "The float voltage is set below the max pack voltage \nto provide safety margin. Since the charger only regulates \ntotal pack voltage, an imbalanced cell group could exceed \nits max voltage even when the pack reads 12.435 V. Lowering the \nfloat voltage helps account for imbalance."
